# Software Requirements Specification (SRS)

This SRS defines the architecture, requirements, APIs, modules,
workflows, testing, deployment, and roadmap for a Desktop Music
Downloader & Library Manager.

## Section 1

Detailed requirements, design decisions, implementation guidance,
acceptance criteria, and notes for section 1.

